{"text":"purananuru","n":117,"lines":["மைம் மீன் புகையினும் தூமம் தோன்றினும்","தென் திசை மருங்கின் வெள்ளி ஓடினும்","வயல்அகம் நிறையப் புதற்பூ மலர","மனைத்தலை மகவை ஈன்ற அமர்க்கண்","ஆமா நெடு நிறை நன்புல் ஆரக்","கோஒல் செம்மையின் சான்றோர் பல்கிப்","பெயல் பிழைப்பு அறியாப் புன்புலத் ததுவே","பிள்ளை வெருகின் முள் லெயிறு புரையப்","பாசிலை முல்லை முகைக்கும்","ஆய் தொடி அரிவையர் தந்தை நாடே"],"tr":["maim mīṉ pukaiyiṉum tūmam tōṉṟiṉum","teṉ ticai maruṅkiṉ veḷḷi ōṭiṉum","vayalakam niṟaiyap putaṟpū malara","maṉaittalai makavai īṉṟa amarkkaṇ","āmā neṭu niṟai naṉpul ārak","kōol cemmaiyiṉ cāṉṟōr palkip","peyal piḻaippu aṟiyāp puṉpulat tatuvē","piḷḷai verukiṉ muḷ leyiṟu puraiyap","pācilai mullai mukaikkum","āy toṭi arivaiyar tantai nāṭē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"potuviyal","tinai_ta":"பொதுவியல்","turai_ta":"கையறுநிலை","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"10 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 36, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 22, veṇṭaḷai 15, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மைம்மீன்","tr":"maimmīṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மைம்","tr":"maim"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மீன்","tr":"mīṉ"}]},{"text":"புகையினும்","tr":"pukaiyiṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புகை","tr":"pukai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினும்","tr":"yiṉum"}]},{"text":"தூமம்","tr":"tūmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூ","tr":"tū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"தோன்றினும்","tr":"tōṉṟiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோன்","tr":"tōṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றினும்","tr":"ṟiṉum"}]}],[{"text":"தென்திசை","tr":"teṉticai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தென்","tr":"teṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திசை","tr":"ticai"}]},{"text":"மருங்கின்","tr":"maruṅkiṉ","foot":"puḷ